# SolvaPay Product Vocabulary

## Deprecated terms

Do not mention the following SolvaPay product names in plans, skills, docs, marketing copy, code comments, anchor articles, trademark lists, roadmaps, or any user-facing artifact:

- **MCP Pay** -- product discontinued. Do not propose features, upsell paths, routing, or any new mentions.

## When you encounter existing mentions

- If you are already editing the file: remove the mention as part of your change.
- If you are not editing the file: flag it for cleanup but do not silently rewrite unrelated files.

## What to suggest instead

When a user's intent matches what a deprecated product used to cover (e.g. hosted / no-code MCP monetization for MCP Pay), do not invent replacement vocabulary. Ask the user which surface they want to route to. Default to the code-based path (`create-paid-mcp-app` skill, SDK integration) if they don't specify.

## Canonical name

The current canonical name for the code-based paid-MCP skill is `create-paid-mcp-app`. Older drafts referenced `create-mcp-app` or split the surface into `openapi-to-mcp` and `building-mcp-app` -- both of those are historical and the consolidated skill at `skills/solvapay/create-paid-mcp-app/` is the only correct destination.
